  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Integrate RPA bots into business processes with the Camunda RPA worker",
    "splashDescription": "Camunda robotic process automation (RPA) enables you to transform isolated task automation by integrating RPA bots into end-to-end business processes. Mix-and-match Camunda RPA bots with bots from other providers to get a complete picture of your processes, from design to runtime to optimization. The RPA connector allows you to execute scripts in the Camunda RPA worker.",
